OL,3,GNEWSAGilts v kilts: What is happening
OL,4,Awith Scottish government bonds?
OL,5,
OL,6,FNamed "kilts", a nod to UK government
OL,7,F"gilts", the scheme has provoked much
OL,8,Fdebate.
